│ ss using it                                                                  │
│ - Check what's running on a port with `lsof -i :<port>` or `ss -tlnp | grep  │
│ <port>`                                                                      │
│ - Prefer random/high ports (e.g., `docker run -p 0:8080`) to avoid conflicts │
│                                                                              │
